        "node_id": "n_2_f03d53",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Generate a sequence starting from 1 and doubling each time until the sum exceeds n, then adjust to fit exactly n problems within k days by ensuring the sequence ends with the exact remaining problems needed to reach n while maintaining the constraints.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
